  // Unit of measure (classic "Unit" / UOM column). This element previously had
  // NO @UI annotation, so it never became a table column - that is why Unit was
  // missing in every mode. Now a proper line item, shown per mode via the
  // controller's MODE_COLUMNS.
  @UI: { lineItem: [ { position: 125, label: 'Unit' } ], identification: [ { position: 125, label: 'Unit' } ] }
